    "Each note (a how-to, an inventory, a measurement, an ideation note) becomes a section of the arc's `plan.md`, under a heading named for its subject, with nothing dropped; then remove the file. A note loose at `notes/` itself goes to the plan of the arc it belongs to, or of the workstream's first open arc where it names none, as the check says.",
