    "Rewrite every link to an arc's data \u2014 `arcs/N<nnn>/state.json` in the approach page, the previews, the plans and the orders \u2014 to the arc's address: `approach.html#N<nnn>` from the approach page, `../../approach.html#N<nnn>` from a preview or a plan, `../../../approach.html#N<nnn>` from an order.",
    "Give each arc its goal from its plan's *What done means*, one or two sentences of the outcome in a reader's words: `spn-devex workstream row write <ws>/N<nnn> --goal \"\u2026\"`. A subject the check names as long is not renamed here: list it for that workstream's own window, whose owner chooses the short name.",
